  "body": "My Synapse server has been working for nine days, and today it stopped responding.\r\n\r\nThe CPU usage is stuck at 100%, and there're many errors regarding to open file limit, like:\r\n\r\n`twisted: [PUT-1187882] Could not accept new connection (EMFILE)`\r\n\r\n````\r\ntwisted: [PUT-1187882] Unhandled Error\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/synapse/app/homeserver.py\", line 455, in in_thread\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/base.py\", line 1199, in run\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/base.py\", line 1208, in mainLoop\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/synapse/metrics/__init__.py\", line 151, in f\r\n    \r\n--- <exception caught here> ---\r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/internet/base.py\", line 828, in runUntilCurrent\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/names/client.py\", line 152, in maybeParseConfig\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/names/client.py\", line 143, in _openFile\r\n    \r\n  File \"/home/synapse/.env/lib/python2.7/site-packages/twisted/python/filepath.py\", line 1014, in open\r\n    \r\nexceptions.IOError: [Errno 24] Too many open files: '/etc/resolv.conf'\r\n````\r\n\r\n[Here is lsof output](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/files/675404/lsof.txt). 192.168.0.2:http-alt is local synapse port, 192.168.0.1 is nginx upstream.\r\n",
